# 02 - Silver Layer: Data Cleansing and Standardisation
Transform raw Bronze data into standardised and structured datasets that are suitable for downstream processing.

## Source tables
- bronze.customers
- bronze.transactions
- bronze.contacts

## Transformations
- Standardise column values.
- Trim unnecessary whitespace.
- Normalise names, emails and phone numbers.
- Convert dates, timestamps and numeric values.
- Identify missing and malformed fields.
- Remove duplicate business records deterministically.
- Add data quality indicators.

## Output tables
- silver.customers
- silver.transactions
- silver.contacts

## Design principle
Invalid records are retained with explicit quality indicators. They will be separated into quarantine tables in the next data quality notebook.

